# {{title}}

LaTeX document (biblatex + biber): `main.tex` -> `main.pdf`.

- Build: `latexmk -pdf main.tex`. Auxiliary files and the PDF are git-ignored.
- Citations: `\cite{key}` with keys from the file in `\addbibresource`; never invent references.
- Figures in `figures/` (already on `\graphicspath`).
- Spelling is checked after each edit (typos); fix what it reports.
